<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS8" title="In 5 Discussion ‣ The Discrete Charm of the MLP:Binary Routing of Continuous Signals in Transformer Feed-Forward Layers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.8 </span>Generalization and Limitations</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
