<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Hyperparameter Sensitivity</h2>

<figure id="A3.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 12</span>: </span><span id="A3.T12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Polynomial <math id="A3.T12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> sensitivity to PCA dimensions and Ridge <math id="A3.T12.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> (Layer 9, degree 3,
100K tokens, cross-validated). The result is stable: no configuration exceeds <math id="A3.T12.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}=0.07" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.07</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}=0.07</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
