<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The result is stable: <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> remains near 0.04 regardless of PCA dimensionality or
regularization strength, confirming that the polynomial failure is not an artifact of
hyperparameter choices.</p>
</div>
